WEBVTT

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:14.389
<i>Neo Xianglong,</i>

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:19.436
<i>an urban center on a peninsula-shaped</i>
<i>piece of land straddled by two rivers.</i>

00:00:19.895 --> 00:00:22.856
<i>It is the largest, most powerful</i>
<i>of the absolute-defense cities</i>

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:25.901
<i>that formed around the world</i>
<i>in response to the experiment</i>

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.695
<i>and subsequent Xianglong Crisis.</i>

00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:31.740
<i>It is called humanity's final fortress.</i>

00:00:31.907 --> 00:00:34.952
It synchronizes with a human's
deep consciousness...

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.078
The hyperdrive--

00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:37.913
Ex-- Excuse me.

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:40.374
That's Leon Lau.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:43.210
The man who brought the world to ruin.

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:17.763
Regular contact from the southwest area
is late.

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:19.848
<i>The recon helicopter</i>
<i>and resupply is delayed.</i>

00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:20.766
2038 Neo Xianglong

00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:22.684
<i>This may cause holes</i>
<i>in the security net.</i>

00:02:22.768 --> 00:02:26.647
It's part of your job to reroute resources
to cover for it, right?

00:02:28.857 --> 00:02:31.318
Why hasn't the
Edible Plant Cultivation Factory

00:02:31.485 --> 00:02:33.987
met this month's supply schedule?

00:02:34.196 --> 00:02:35.697
<i>I'm shorthanded.</i>

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.492
<i>I need you to get me more personnel.</i>

00:02:38.617 --> 00:02:39.618
Rejected.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:43.330
Formulate a new plan
and submit it by today.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.958
As you can see, Captain Gren,

00:02:47.209 --> 00:02:50.462
unfortunately, our city is suffering from
chronic personnel shortages.

00:02:50.545 --> 00:02:52.923
<i>I can't spare one man more for security.</i>

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:56.009
We haven't even finished repairs
on the area that guy destroyed!

00:02:56.093 --> 00:02:59.888
<i>You divert money and people for that</i>
<i>outsider, but what about us?</i>

00:02:59.971 --> 00:03:03.100
<i>At any rate, your request is rejected.</i>
<i>Return to duty.</i>

00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:05.102
Hey! Goddamn it!

00:03:05.727 --> 00:03:07.604
It's pampered brats like him...

00:03:12.109 --> 00:03:15.153
How has Pandora been doing
since last time?

00:03:15.445 --> 00:03:17.406
We're preparing a base for it.

00:03:17.489 --> 00:03:18.698
What about Leon Lau?

00:03:20.158 --> 00:03:23.328
If we can mass produce the hyperdrive
that he brought,

00:03:23.537 --> 00:03:25.163
fighting may become easier.

00:03:25.455 --> 00:03:29.000
To be frank,
that system is very dangerous.

00:03:29.459 --> 00:03:33.004
And that Leon Lau,
I believe he's hiding something.

00:03:33.588 --> 00:03:35.215
He is not to be trusted.

00:03:35.507 --> 00:03:39.219
Honestly, I was reluctant to even allow
outsiders in the city.

00:03:39.928 --> 00:03:44.057
With the weaponry we have now,
can we repel any BRAI we may encounter?

00:03:46.226 --> 00:03:49.646
I am not the type to sit and wait
for death to come to me.

00:04:08.373 --> 00:04:09.583
I drank too much.

00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:11.209
You're a good shot.

00:04:11.835 --> 00:04:14.880
I heard you were a truck driver
before the Crisis.

00:04:14.963 --> 00:04:16.757
Where did you learn to shoot?

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:19.301
It was a hobby. I did a little hunting.

00:04:19.468 --> 00:04:20.635
Oh, a hobby?

00:04:20.802 --> 00:04:22.345
Are you sure this is okay?

00:04:22.512 --> 00:04:25.056
I'm getting paid
to do nothing but goof off.

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:28.185
-You partied last night, too?
-We are<i></i>in Neo Xianglong.

00:04:28.518 --> 00:04:31.188
And each bar had
girls prettier than the last.

00:04:32.814 --> 00:04:34.733
Commander Beard! Doug!

00:04:35.066 --> 00:04:37.402
Hey, little sis.
Another day on the job?

00:04:37.486 --> 00:04:38.653
My name is Chloe.

00:04:38.862 --> 00:04:40.489
Have you seen Leon?

00:04:40.697 --> 00:04:44.743
No. Come to think of it,
why are you here every day, little girl?

00:04:44.826 --> 00:04:46.203
My name is Chloe!

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:49.956
Leon has awful sense of direction,
so he can't get here alone.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.833
How did you get in?

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:55.253
Leon gave this to me.

00:04:55.337 --> 00:04:56.463
An ID card?

00:04:56.838 --> 00:04:58.089
Let me see that.

00:04:58.256 --> 00:05:00.050
This is pretty darn well made.

00:05:00.217 --> 00:05:01.593
It's a fake.

00:05:02.385 --> 00:05:04.179
Can you believe that guy?

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.473
Not bad, Mr. Scientist.

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:08.975
This is a fake?

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:13.438
I'm sorry.

00:05:13.855 --> 00:05:17.150
I was so lost in thought,
I didn't notice. I'm sorry.

00:05:18.026 --> 00:05:19.402
Darn it, Leon!

00:05:19.611 --> 00:05:21.279
Chloe? Where am I?

00:05:21.446 --> 00:05:23.281
I've tried to get ahold of you!

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:29.955
Family contract, Article 62.

00:05:30.121 --> 00:05:32.374
-"Answer all messages!"
-Yes.

00:05:32.457 --> 00:05:35.836
You even went and bought this thing.
What was the point?

00:05:36.378 --> 00:05:38.171
So, where were you going?

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:42.133
-To the hangar.
-The hangar is right here!

00:05:43.009 --> 00:05:45.011
They said my ID card is a fake.

00:05:45.303 --> 00:05:47.681
Don't blame me if we get banished again.

00:05:48.348 --> 00:05:50.517
-That hurts, Chloe!
-No, it doesn't!

00:05:50.642 --> 00:05:51.643
My ear!

00:05:51.726 --> 00:05:54.271
No mercy for ears that don't listen!

00:05:54.354 --> 00:05:56.064
-That's<i></i>Leon Lau?
-You bumbling klutz!

00:05:56.147 --> 00:05:58.024
He caused the reactor incident?

00:05:58.984 --> 00:06:00.986
Even now, I still can't believe

00:06:01.653 --> 00:06:04.990
that he's one of the people
that changed the world.

00:06:05.323 --> 00:06:07.200
Does it bother you, too?

00:06:07.701 --> 00:06:09.786
If you're asking if I resent him...

00:06:10.245 --> 00:06:12.956
Everyone has skeletons in the closet.

00:06:14.124 --> 00:06:16.167
His is just a damn big skeleton.

00:06:17.168 --> 00:06:18.878
Doesn't matter to me, though.

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:23.592
Why does someone have to be inside it
to fight the BRAI?

00:06:23.925 --> 00:06:27.846
To ignite the hyperdrive,
a human has to be nearby.

00:06:27.971 --> 00:06:28.805
Why?

00:06:29.931 --> 00:06:33.310
Well, when the hyperdrive synchronizes
with a person's deep consciousness--

00:06:34.102 --> 00:06:36.062
Leon! That's bad manners!

00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:39.274
Family contract, Article 18.
"No snacking!"

00:06:39.524 --> 00:06:42.444
I couldn't eat mahua outside the city.

00:06:42.902 --> 00:06:46.781
Besides, when I synch with the hyperdrive,
I burn a lot of energy.

00:06:50.285 --> 00:06:51.745
Look, it's him.

00:06:51.828 --> 00:06:54.539
What's he doing here?
He has a lot of nerve.

00:06:58.335 --> 00:06:59.419
Secretary Jay?

00:07:01.379 --> 00:07:03.506
What is this "important matter,"

00:07:04.382 --> 00:07:05.258
Secretary Jay?

00:07:05.842 --> 00:07:09.012
My family has worked with
the Princess' family

00:07:09.095 --> 00:07:13.308
for generations to govern and protect
the city of Xianglong.

00:07:14.434 --> 00:07:19.272
The Princess believes that the hyperdrive
can be mass produced and used for combat.

00:07:19.481 --> 00:07:21.483
Yes, please! That's why I made it.

00:07:22.192 --> 00:07:23.944
But I'm opposed to it.

00:07:25.195 --> 00:07:27.572
<i>While you certainly did defeat the BRAI,</i>

00:07:28.031 --> 00:07:30.200
<i>you then immediately lost consciousness,</i>

00:07:30.283 --> 00:07:32.661
<i>and damaged the absolute-defense system.</i>

00:07:34.496 --> 00:07:35.580
That is a problem.

00:07:35.664 --> 00:07:39.376
We will run an experiment
to confirm the hyperdrive's abilities.

00:07:39.584 --> 00:07:42.420
If humans cannot endure using it,
we'll scrap it.

00:07:42.629 --> 00:07:47.008
<i>As of now, all research and development</i>
<i>within Neo Xianglong is prohibited.</i>

00:07:47.384 --> 00:07:49.761
<i>The Princess has already given approval.</i>

00:07:51.554 --> 00:07:52.722
Complaints?

00:07:53.306 --> 00:07:56.059
No. I believe your judgment is correct.

00:07:56.893 --> 00:07:57.727
Good.

00:07:58.144 --> 00:07:59.896
We'll supply the pilot.

00:08:00.897 --> 00:08:01.731
What's wrong?

00:08:01.815 --> 00:08:05.652
The hyperdrive is ignited by synchronizing
with a human's deep consciousness.

00:08:05.819 --> 00:08:08.738
I still don't know for sure
what kind of an impact

00:08:08.863 --> 00:08:12.909
that has on the pilot yet.
I'll handle the piloting for these tests.

00:08:13.576 --> 00:08:14.577
Rejected.

00:08:15.453 --> 00:08:19.499
We'll have military personnel pilot it,
in order to adequately test its abilities.

00:08:19.749 --> 00:08:21.501
I can't guarantee their survival.

00:08:21.751 --> 00:08:24.045
They could be left
with some kind of aftereffect.

00:08:24.295 --> 00:08:26.756
Military personnel are prepared for that.

00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:31.469
Or do you, amateur that you are,
intend to pilot that thing yourself

00:08:31.678 --> 00:08:33.388
and fight the BRAI?

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:36.349
I understand.

00:08:36.808 --> 00:08:39.936
However,
we should take all possible precautions.

00:08:40.186 --> 00:08:42.105
The test is tomorrow at noon.

00:08:42.355 --> 00:08:45.025
Finish your preparations by then.
That is all.

00:08:45.525 --> 00:08:47.360
-What is it?
-Well, actually...

00:08:48.194 --> 00:08:51.906
Thanks for taking care of things
so that we could live here.

00:08:52.073 --> 00:08:54.784
My little sister...
Chloe was very happy about it.

00:08:55.118 --> 00:08:56.578
I simply did my job.

00:08:56.911 --> 00:08:59.998
Contact me if you need anything else.
Though supplies are scarce.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:01.499
Thank you very much.

00:09:05.045 --> 00:09:06.046
More to say?

00:09:06.546 --> 00:09:09.966
You know, I really do feel like
we've met somewhere before.

00:09:26.566 --> 00:09:29.069
-A rice field?
-It's a food factory.

00:09:29.611 --> 00:09:31.237
<i>After the reactor incident,</i>

00:09:31.321 --> 00:09:33.615
<i>the population crashed,</i>
<i>and the empty buildings</i>

00:09:33.698 --> 00:09:36.743
were turned into factories and hospitals.

00:09:49.089 --> 00:09:50.340
Get out of here!

00:09:50.423 --> 00:09:52.342
This was your fault!

00:09:52.425 --> 00:09:54.719
Look what's happened to our city!

00:10:01.142 --> 00:10:04.395
Miss, we've got some cute stuff in here.
How about this?

00:10:08.024 --> 00:10:09.025
Queenie!

00:10:10.026 --> 00:10:13.029
Oh, wow!
I can't believe I ran into you here! Wow!

00:10:13.113 --> 00:10:14.656
So, you're still in Neo Xianglong.

00:10:14.739 --> 00:10:15.698
TRADITIONAL SOUVENIRS

00:10:15.782 --> 00:10:17.826
Yeah. Why are you two still here?

00:10:18.034 --> 00:10:20.870
Leon accepted a job with Commander Beard.

00:10:21.079 --> 00:10:24.332
That's right. I've joined a special team
that's fighting the BRAI.

00:10:24.666 --> 00:10:26.417
You're fighting the BRAI?

00:10:26.709 --> 00:10:29.337
Not me. I think I'll mostly be doing

00:10:29.546 --> 00:10:32.382
research and development
and logistical support.

00:10:34.592 --> 00:10:37.303
Could you sense death
from that MOEV of yours?

00:10:38.012 --> 00:10:40.348
<i>A darkness so deep and so cold,</i>

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.434
<i>even the warmth of blood</i>
<i>can't be felt.</i>

00:10:47.313 --> 00:10:51.109
The day may come
when you lose your handle on it.

00:10:51.442 --> 00:10:52.277
Be careful.

00:10:54.571 --> 00:10:56.447
Queenie...

00:11:03.621 --> 00:11:07.750
The quantum reactor admittedly
looks promising as the future of energy.

00:11:08.126 --> 00:11:10.837
However, much about it is unknown.

00:11:11.462 --> 00:11:13.965
Are you sure it was right to invest in it?

00:11:14.424 --> 00:11:17.176
You cannot get a tiger cub
without entering the den.

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:19.971
You must confirm everything
with your own eyes.

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.807
That is the duty of my family,

00:11:23.099 --> 00:11:25.810
which has protected Xianglong
for generations.

00:11:32.233 --> 00:11:33.651
Thank you for coming.

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:35.820
I am at the service of the Mayor.

00:11:36.195 --> 00:11:40.366
Doctor Lon,
my father sends his regards as well.

00:11:43.036 --> 00:11:43.912
Leon!

00:11:44.412 --> 00:11:45.330
Leon Lau.

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:50.877
Let me introduce you to my assistant
and the chief of my research team.

00:11:53.046 --> 00:11:54.213
Nice to meet you.

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:57.216
I'm Leon Lau.

00:12:00.929 --> 00:12:01.763
<i>That day...</i>

00:12:02.555 --> 00:12:04.140
<i>everything changed.</i>

00:12:09.103 --> 00:12:11.314
The Mayor's body has been discovered.

00:12:12.273 --> 00:12:13.399
My father is...

00:12:14.025 --> 00:12:17.028
The Xiangin Corporation CEO,
Edgar Kim,

00:12:17.111 --> 00:12:19.656
has assumed command of the control center.

00:12:19.739 --> 00:12:23.534
-And the Reactor Research Facility?
-There was only one survivor.

00:12:23.743 --> 00:12:24.786
Dr. Lon is dead.

00:12:25.662 --> 00:12:27.246
Who is the survivor?

00:12:27.705 --> 00:12:29.666
Leon. Leon Lau.

00:12:30.083 --> 00:12:32.877
<i>He's working to curb</i>
<i>the out of control reactor.</i>

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:39.258
<i>After the Xianglong Crisis,</i>

00:12:39.801 --> 00:12:42.136
<i>those things,</i>
<i>the BRAI, were born.</i>

00:13:07.704 --> 00:13:09.414
<i>It's unbelievable</i>

00:13:09.539 --> 00:13:12.625
that they've evolved this rapidly
so soon after the reactor incident.

00:13:12.709 --> 00:13:14.794
Our current weaponry is no match for them.

00:13:14.961 --> 00:13:17.046
What in the world are these things?

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.090
They're BRAI.

00:13:19.632 --> 00:13:22.093
"Biological Revolutionary
of Accelerated Intellect."

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:25.096
We must develop
countermeasures immediately.

00:13:25.179 --> 00:13:26.931
Several companies in our Yifong Group

00:13:27.015 --> 00:13:31.894
have been jointly developing
a next-generation combat vehicle.

00:13:32.729 --> 00:13:34.355
It may be of some help.

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:36.566
Also...

00:13:41.195 --> 00:13:42.613
It's quite ironic.

00:13:43.406 --> 00:13:46.451
The Quantum Reactor changed the world,
but we're using its power

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:50.246
to construct an absolute-defense system
to protect the city.

00:13:50.496 --> 00:13:52.623
This is the most reasonable method.

00:13:52.999 --> 00:13:57.336
With the BRAI being attracted to
the reactor's leaking evolutionary field,

00:13:57.587 --> 00:13:59.422
won't they attack the city?

00:14:00.006 --> 00:14:02.467
I believe that is a very likely scenario.

00:14:03.634 --> 00:14:07.472
You mean even though you made the reactor,
you don't know everything about it?

00:14:08.014 --> 00:14:11.309
Even we didn't know what was inside.

00:14:11.809 --> 00:14:14.604
Aware of this fact, we opened it anyway.

00:14:16.189 --> 00:14:17.648
It's a Pandora's Box.

00:14:19.233 --> 00:14:20.234
Pandora...

00:14:22.779 --> 00:14:26.991
Some people are critical of your decision
to lift Leon Lau's banishment.

00:14:27.492 --> 00:14:30.661
Who knows what they'll do
to remove you from power, Princess.

00:14:30.995 --> 00:14:32.997
Then we'll have to fight them.

00:14:33.164 --> 00:14:37.710
If we are to construct a new world,
we can't be picky about the means we use.

00:14:38.252 --> 00:14:40.671
Pay a visit to those who have complaints.

00:14:41.506 --> 00:14:45.134
Ask them if they can protect humanity
by their methods.

00:14:49.972 --> 00:14:51.182
Bad manners again.

00:14:51.599 --> 00:14:52.850
I'm hungry.

00:14:53.184 --> 00:14:57.355
That's why I said we should go get dinner.
The cafeteria's closed now.

00:14:57.480 --> 00:15:00.358
But I have to finish this up by tomorrow.

00:15:00.566 --> 00:15:02.360
I see you're still hard at it.

00:15:04.946 --> 00:15:07.323
I'm so sorry.

00:15:08.032 --> 00:15:10.535
Forget about that. This is more important.

00:15:13.746 --> 00:15:15.832
Eat up. For all your hard work.

00:15:17.667 --> 00:15:20.044
Xianglong ramen!

00:15:22.755 --> 00:15:24.507
Wow, oh wow!

00:15:24.882 --> 00:15:28.678
Thin, firm noodles
and the aroma of sesame and mala sauce.

00:15:29.178 --> 00:15:30.430
What's that?

00:15:30.805 --> 00:15:32.932
Japanese pepper. It's good!

00:15:33.391 --> 00:15:35.977
You see, it's even used
in herbal medicine.

00:15:36.352 --> 00:15:38.855
-How about some, little girl?
-My name is Chloe.

00:15:39.313 --> 00:15:40.565
No, thank you.

00:15:40.648 --> 00:15:43.192
I've heard that Japanese pepper stimulates

00:15:43.276 --> 00:15:45.445
the central nervous system
and brain activity.

00:15:45.653 --> 00:15:49.157
But excessive consumption has been known
to cause loss of consciousness.

00:15:49.699 --> 00:15:54.078
Everyone needs a little thrill, you know.
Your MOEV does the same, right?

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.915
How's tomorrow's test looking?

00:15:58.082 --> 00:16:00.585
I'm installing a limiter
on the hyperdrive.

00:16:00.751 --> 00:16:01.878
A limiter?

00:16:02.503 --> 00:16:06.215
The hyperdrive
extracts energy from multiple dimensions

00:16:06.382 --> 00:16:08.759
by synchronizing with the pilot's
deep consciousness.

00:16:08.843 --> 00:16:10.595
Multiple dimensions? What's that?

00:16:10.678 --> 00:16:12.638
<i>When the hyperdrive is activated,</i>

00:16:12.722 --> 00:16:15.308
<i>bridges between different dimensions</i>
<i>are created.</i>

00:16:15.391 --> 00:16:18.269
<i>So, it pulls energy from other dimensions?</i>

00:16:18.352 --> 00:16:21.981
<i>That's not precisely how it works,</i>
<i>but that's one way to understand it.</i>

00:16:22.106 --> 00:16:25.318
<i>As a result, the pilot's psyche</i>
<i>is put under immense stress,</i>

00:16:25.401 --> 00:16:26.652
<i>and in the worst case...</i>

00:16:27.445 --> 00:16:30.114
there's a chance of
suffering a mental breakdown.

00:16:34.327 --> 00:16:36.078
Captain Gren, what is it?

00:16:36.954 --> 00:16:38.581
Get on your feet, Leon Lau!

00:16:44.921 --> 00:16:46.005
Leon!

00:16:46.422 --> 00:16:47.673
Why did you do that?!

00:16:47.757 --> 00:16:50.468
-I volunteered to be the test pilot.
-Volunteered?

00:16:50.927 --> 00:16:53.846
I can't allow my subordinates
to face this danger.

00:16:54.138 --> 00:16:55.473
I am their commander.

00:16:57.225 --> 00:16:59.477
I swore to protect this city.

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:01.062
I'm not afraid of dying.

00:17:01.312 --> 00:17:03.397
But if I do, it'll be too late
to complain,

00:17:03.481 --> 00:17:05.107
so I came to tell you this first.

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:09.946
After the reactor incident,
my parents were killed by BRAI.

00:17:10.863 --> 00:17:12.114
My two brothers, too.

00:17:13.699 --> 00:17:14.700
It's your fault!

00:17:15.576 --> 00:17:17.537
It's because you made that thing!

00:17:17.787 --> 00:17:21.415
All you scientists ever want to do
is satisfy yourselves!

00:17:21.874 --> 00:17:24.210
You couldn't care less about our lives!

00:17:24.502 --> 00:17:27.588
That's right!
It's all your fault that everyone died!

00:17:28.422 --> 00:17:31.050
Are you going to say
you had good intentions?

00:17:31.133 --> 00:17:33.386
That good intentions excuse anything?

00:17:33.886 --> 00:17:35.388
I will never forgive you!

00:17:35.972 --> 00:17:38.432
I will never, ever forgive you!

00:17:38.683 --> 00:17:39.934
Shut your damn mouth!

00:17:40.226 --> 00:17:43.729
You have no idea how hard
Leon worked to control the reactor

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:46.482
and build the absolute-defense system!

00:17:47.149 --> 00:17:51.237
It's not all Leon's fault,
but still, you banished him!

00:17:51.654 --> 00:17:54.907
Even after he was banished,
Leon has always... always...

00:17:55.741 --> 00:17:57.201
worked for this city.

00:17:58.536 --> 00:18:00.746
-Chloe...
-For the city? Are you nuts?

00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:02.039
Captain Gren!

00:18:02.915 --> 00:18:05.751
I understand how you feel,
but that's enough.

00:18:07.837 --> 00:18:11.340
I cannot promise
that tomorrow's test will succeed.

00:18:11.716 --> 00:18:13.968
But, to protect your life,

00:18:14.051 --> 00:18:17.096
-I'll make every effort--
-Spare me the lip service.

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:20.016
Anyway, now I can die without any regrets.

00:18:23.561 --> 00:18:25.104
Are you all right, Chloe?

00:18:25.187 --> 00:18:28.274
You can't be a bumble tomorrow.
You have to prove them wrong.

00:18:28.357 --> 00:18:30.776
Or else I'll tear up our family contract!

00:18:31.402 --> 00:18:32.987
I'll do my best.

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:35.615
-Okay, just a little more to go.
-Family contract?

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:48.669
I had too much to drink again.

00:18:56.385 --> 00:18:59.263
<i>The Hyperdrive Ignition Test</i>
<i>will now commence.</i>

00:18:59.805 --> 00:19:02.224
I won't let anyone do any further damage.

00:19:02.642 --> 00:19:04.226
This is for Neo Xianglong!

00:19:28.292 --> 00:19:31.087
<i>Only 3.7 points</i>
<i>until hyperdrive criticality.</i>

00:19:31.545 --> 00:19:33.839
This will work! I can do this!

00:19:39.553 --> 00:19:40.721
Oh, no!

00:19:42.723 --> 00:19:43.641
The limiter...

00:19:44.141 --> 00:19:45.226
isn't functioning!

00:19:57.363 --> 00:19:58.364
Stop Gren!

00:19:58.656 --> 00:20:00.032
-Roger!
-Roger!

00:20:04.286 --> 00:20:05.287
Stay away!

00:20:06.789 --> 00:20:08.165
-Oh, no!
-What the...

00:20:11.836 --> 00:20:13.045
Gren!

00:20:13.421 --> 00:20:14.547
What are you doing?

00:20:22.221 --> 00:20:24.807
Should I shoot or what, Mr. Secretary?

00:20:25.099 --> 00:20:26.434
Wait!

00:20:29.562 --> 00:20:30.563
Hurry up!

00:20:30.646 --> 00:20:31.647
Thank you!

00:20:34.442 --> 00:20:35.901
Gren, I'm stopping it!

00:20:36.694 --> 00:20:40.573
<i>Gren! Gren! Can you hear me?</i>

00:20:40.823 --> 00:20:42.825
-<i>Gren!</i>
-<i>Gren!</i>

00:20:43.284 --> 00:20:44.744
-<i>Gren!</i>
-<i>Captain Gren!</i>

00:20:45.911 --> 00:20:46.912
Gren!

00:20:47.538 --> 00:20:49.832
Gren! Are you okay?

00:20:50.166 --> 00:20:51.959
Gren! Can you hear me?

00:20:52.084 --> 00:20:55.171
-Leon Lau...
-Gren! Come out through here!

00:21:10.352 --> 00:21:11.604
Snap out of it, Gren!

00:21:16.692 --> 00:21:18.527
Thank goodness, Gren.

00:21:19.487 --> 00:21:20.404
Leon...

00:21:21.322 --> 00:21:22.364
You...

00:21:24.283 --> 00:21:25.868
That got pretty heated.

00:21:26.744 --> 00:21:27.745
What?

00:21:30.289 --> 00:21:33.626
Don't puke, boy. I don't have a barf bag.

00:21:35.461 --> 00:21:37.129
You feeling sick, too?

00:21:38.839 --> 00:21:40.508
Who? Me?

00:21:50.684 --> 00:21:51.685
Leon Lau.

00:21:54.188 --> 00:21:55.189
What is it?

00:21:55.523 --> 00:21:57.066
<i>We have a recon plane report.</i>

00:21:57.274 --> 00:22:00.653
<i>One super-gigachalice class BRAI,</i>
<i>120km to the east-southeast,</i>

00:22:00.861 --> 00:22:02.738
<i>advancing toward Neo Xianglong!</i>

00:23:46.842 --> 00:23:50.346
NEXT
OPERATION HOWL BREAKTHROUGH

00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:51.889
Subtitle translation by Amanda Miller
